IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `spr-part6-graduated`

-- Tests for regulations 15 to 20 (spr-part6-graduated.l4).
-- Expected values are decided from the text of the regulation named beside each
-- group, before running. Percentages are written 5% for 0.05.

§ `Fixtures`
`base: spouse died 1 Mar 2010, person reaches pensionable age 1 Jan 2020` MEANS SpouseDeathFacts WITH
    `the day on which the question is asked` IS YMD 2026 6 1
    `the date the person reaches pensionable age` IS YMD 2020 1 1
    `the kind of relationship` IS `married to each other`
    `the spouse or civil partner died while the two were married or civil partners of each other` IS TRUE
    `either of them was married to a third person at the time of the death` IS FALSE
    `the date the spouse or civil partner died` IS YMD 2010 3 1
    `the person has married or formed a civil partnership between the date of death and the date they reached pensionable age` IS FALSE
